# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime / user data — never belongs in the repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real user state lives in ~/.fthr/ (settings.json, hotkeys.json,
# upload_history.json). These patterns catch stray copies dropped into the tree.
.fthr/
settings.json
settings.json.tmp
settings.json.corrupt
hotkeys.json
upload_history.json
*.log
*.dmp
crashdumps/

